ン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,91.2 9.1,94.2 14.2,95.8 19.3,97.2 24.5,90.9 29.6,88.2 34.7,86.0 39.8,84.5 44.9,81.8 50.0,82.3 55.1,78.5 60.3,75.9 65.4,76.2 70.5,76.1 75.6,74.0 80.7,74.3 85.8,69.4 91.0,65.0 96.1,61.7 101.2,60.0 106.3,60.9 111.4,58.0 116.5,49.9 121.6,53.0 126.8,50.8 131.9,51.7 137.0,54.2 142.1,57.6 147.2,52.4 152.3,51.1 157.4,54.6 162.6,47.4 167.7,47.0 172.8,44.8 177.9,58.0 183.0,52.2 188.1,57.1 193.2,50.2 198.4,48.4 203.5,46.9 208.6,53.3 213.7,50.3 218.8,47.3 223.9,47.4 229.0,44.1 234.2,44.5 239.3,37.6 244.4,37.4 249.5,35.3 254.6,36.1 259.7,35.3 264.9,39.1 270.0,32.4 275.1,25.9 280.2,31.8 285.3,24.6 290.4,19.5 295.5,20.0 300.7,20.9 305.8,17.6 310.9,12.8 316.0,17.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"17.1\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,94.3 6.1,97.2 8.3,94.9 10.4,95.3 12.5,95.3 14.7,92.7 16.8,94.6 19.0,94.9 21.1,92.8 23.2,93.2 25.4,89.7 27.5,93.5 29.6,93.4 31.8,93.4 33.9,93.5 36.1,93.5 38.2,92.5 40.3,92.6 42.5,92.4 44.6,90.7 46.7,90.4 48.9,89.5 51.0,90.1 53.2,90.1 55.3,87.6 57.4,88.2 59.6,88.5 61.7,88.5 63.8,85.8 66.0,8